        <groundspeak:log id="536528611">
          <groundspeak:date>2015-08-23T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Didn't find it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="3343813">chevyragtop</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP272 Tilley 

Touring Southern Alberta and finding a few caps. Reading previous logs this cap was down a ways but due to  recent rains the hole had sloughed in and  would have required a mini excavator to expose the numbers. Therefore will have to leave this one for another time. TFTBC&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
