        <groundspeak:log id="510110054">
          <groundspeak:date>2015-06-07T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="2176405">Andronicus</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP272 - Tilly &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinates 

Actual: N50 26.881 W111 38.950

Phone: N50 26.881 W111 38.952

Accuracy: 2m &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elevation 

Actual: 753m

Phone: 742m

Accuracy:11m&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A lovely spot for a stop along the full irrigation canal. This one was easy (in the bottom of a deep hole). After clearing the layer of dirt off, I was able to get the photo. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I made my way back to the hiway over some gravel roads, and saw a pronghorn antelope about 20m off the road. I think that was the first one I have ever seen!&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
        <groundspeak:log id="462024461">
