          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP272 Tilley

The locations is pretty obvious but I had to dig some dirt out of the hole to get the picture. TFTC!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This entry was edited by JnJ H on Tuesday, 18 November 2014 at 22:04:25 UTC.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
