        <groundspeak:log id="459439280">
          <groundspeak:date>2014-11-02T20:00:00</groundspeak:date>
          <groundspeak:type>Found it</groundspeak:type>
          <groundspeak:finder id="4853503">gumbyphv</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP272 Tilley&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Making my way home to Red Deer from Moose Jaw I decided to head in and grab this cap.  I wasn't expecting the condition of the road though.  During the snowstorm this road turned into a mud trail that I felt pretty lucky to even make it through.  Once I got to the cap I found the deep hole.  A quick cleanup of the mud and there was the cap.  TFTBC  &lt;img src="/images/icons/icon_smile_big.gif" border="0" align="middle" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
        </groundspeak:log>
